" distress beacon was nothing but a decoy for a pirate ambush."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4929
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"TRAP_BEACON_TEXT\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Your cockpit lights up with warning signals. You are being targeted by a "
"nearby ship. The distress call was a lure to attract unwitting ships into "
"weapons range. You prepare for a fight."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4930
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"TRAP_BEACON_TEXT\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"As soon as you arrive at the distress signal, shots are fired toward your "
"ship. A trap!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4934
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You follow the distress beacon to a tiny asteroid belt. You find a small "
"ship struggling to maneuver through the field."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4937
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hail them to offer assistance."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4941
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Don't approach them."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4947
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/text"
msgstr "They respond: \"Help! Our shields are down and we won't last long!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4949
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Try to shield their ship with yours."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4953
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Don't risk our ship. Leave them to their fate."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4957
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"DRONES_DEFENSE_LIST\"]/text"
msgstr "(Defense Drone) Use a Defense Drone to protect their ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4961
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"DRONES_REPAIR_LIST\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(System Repair Drone) Send a System Repair Drone to fix their Shields."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4965
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"teleporter\"]/text"
msgstr "(Teleporter) Offer to beam them aboard your ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4969
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"ROCK_ARMOR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Rock Armor Plating) Shield their ship with yours and escort them out."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4971
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"ROCK_ARMOR\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You succeed in preventing them from being entirely destroyed, your improved "
"hull taking the brunt of the asteroids that make it past your defenses. They"
" offer you some of the scrap and fuel they were mining out of the asteroid "
"as thanks."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4976
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"ENERGY_SHIELD\"]/text"
msgstr "(Zoltan Shield) Shield their ship with yours and escort them out."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4978
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"ENERGY_SHIELD\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You succeed in preventing them from being entirely destroyed, your energy "
"shield taking the brunt of the asteroids. They offer you some of the scrap "
"and fuel they were mining out of the asteroid as thanks."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4983
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_SYSTEM_REQ\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Repair Burst) Escort the civilians by firing at their ship with repair "
"bursts."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4985
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_SYSTEM_REQ\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Repair bursts eliminate some critical damage to their systems. You then get "
"out of the asteroid field."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4992
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_SYSTEM_REQ\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"In gratitude, they offer you a bit of scrap and fuel, which they extracted "
"from the asteroid."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:4999
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_NANO_REQ\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Hull Repair Burst) Escort the civilians by firing at their ship with repair"
" bursts."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5001
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_NANO_REQ\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Repair bursts eliminate some critical damage to their systems. You then get "
"out of the asteroid field."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5008
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_2\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_NANO_REQ\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"In gratitude, they offer you a bit of scrap and fuel, which they extracted "
"from the asteroid."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5021
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST1\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"You succeed in preventing them from being entirely destroyed, but your ship "
"took a number of hits in the process. They offer some of the scrap and fuel "
"they were mining out of the asteroid as thanks."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5026
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST1\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You try your best but one stray rock hits a key structure in their ship. It "
"breaks apart in front of your eyes. You salvage what you can before leaving,"
" and try not to think about the lost crew."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5030
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST1\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"Despite your best efforts, the civilian ship breaks apart from the constant "
"barrage. You are barely able to break out of the asteroid field yourself. "
"The ship sustains some damage in the process."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5037
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST2\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"Your drone succeeds in keeping their ship from breaking apart while they fix"
" it, however you take some damage while attempting to leave the asteroid "
"field. They offer you some military supplies as thanks for saving them."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5047
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST2\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"The drone keeps the ship stable enough to allow them to escape the asteroid "
"field. They message you with map coordinates, \"You're that Federation ship "
"the Rebels are after, aren't you? I can't offer much but I heard there was a"
" Federation loyalist base nearby. Maybe they can help you?\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5056
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST3\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"They reluctantly agree. Once aboard, you watch as their ship crashes against"
" a massive rock. They thank you, but say \"I don't know what we'll do "
"without our ship. As the Captain, I feel obligated to help you with your "
"mission.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5060
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST3\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"They refuse at first, but after another blast rocks their ship they agree "
"and beam aboard your ship. They say, \"Thank you but we really should return"
" to our families... I'm sure we can muster up a reward if you take us "
"home.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5062
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST3\"]/event[2]/choice/text"
msgstr "Take them to the nearby planet, where they're from."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5069
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST4\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"You regretfully leave the area, not able to watch them get destroyed. A "
"short while later you get a second message, \"We survived, no thanks to you!"
" Don't think I don't know that the Rebels are hunting for you. I'll be sure "
"to tell them where you are the next time I see them!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5073
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"CIVILIAN_ASTEROIDS_BEACON_LIST4\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You watch helplessly as their ship smashes against a cruiser-sized rock..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5080
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Once you arrive at the location of the distress call a civilian ship hails "
"you, \"Thanks for responding to our beacon. Our FTL navigation has gone "
"haywire and we can't plot a course to the nearest depot to get it fixed. "
"Could you lead us there?\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5084
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Lead them to their destination."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5086
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Take this bit of scrap as a down-payment. We'll use your jump signatures "
"to follow you. You're really helping us out here.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5092
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5094
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Alright... If you're not going that way I guess it can't be helped. We'll "
"just wait for the next ship to come.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5099
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[@req=\"FTL_JUMPER_GOOD\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Advanced FTL Navigation) Have your navigation software calculate and upload"
" route instructions to their ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5101
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"ESCORT_BEACON\"]/choice[@req=\"FTL_JUMPER_GOOD\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"We're receiving your transmission... Wow, I didn't know that chain-jumping"
" was possible with this class of ship. We'll get back in a single jump! "
"Thank you so much, please accept this.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5112
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Aid the Federation ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5114
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You power up your weapons and engage the Rebel ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5120
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Use this chance to escape."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5122
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Rebel's preoccupation with the Federation ship allows you to slip away "
"undetected. However you can't help but feel you should have helped them."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5127
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"Upon arriving at this beacon, you detect a distress call. Local scans reveal"
" that a Federation transport is under attack from a Rebel scout!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5128
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You immediately notice a Rebel ship chasing what appears to be a civilian "
"transport. However you are detecting chatter on an encrypted Federation "
"channel... That transport is carrying Federation loyalists!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5129
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//textList[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"Your sensors are picking up a distress call on an encrypted Federation "
"channel. You eventually find a Federation scout being chased by a Rebel "
"fighter!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5133
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thank you for saving us. This ship is transporting Federation civilians on"
" the run from the rebellion and we don't have the equipment to fight for "
"ourselves. I don't have much to offer, but I can inform you of a hidden "
"Federation base nearby. Perhaps they can assist you more.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5138
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST\"]/event[3]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Thanks, we didn't think there would be Rebel ships all the way out here. "
"They seem to be searching for something. Take some extra supplies as thanks "
"for your aid.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5144
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Their ship looks to be on the verge of destruction and life signs are fading"
" quickly."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5146
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Quickly try to rescue the crew."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5148
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Despite your efforts the majority do not survive. The sole survivor offers "
"to join your crew and helps you strip the now derelict ship of useful "
"components."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5154
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"NANO_MEDBAY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Engi Med-bot Dispersal) Pump their ship with Nano Med-bots to aid in the "
"rescue."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5156
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"NANO_MEDBAY\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You drag the injured and dying crew on to your ship. The Med-bots help "
"stabilize their condition, but most perish. The surviving shields operator "
"offers to join your crew and helps you strip their broken ship of scrap."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5162
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"teleporter\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Teleporter) Lock on to all remaining life signatures and beam them onto "
"your ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5164
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"teleporter\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your quick reactions allow you to stabilize a few of the seriously wounded "
"crew members. An infantryman offers to join your crew and the rest tell you "
"of a hidden Federation base a few jumps from here."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5171
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_REQ\"]/text"
msgstr "(Healing Burst) Use a healing burst to keep them alive."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5173
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_REQ\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You launch a healing burst into their ship and the Nanobots are able to keep"
" the crew stabilized. Once they come to, you send over some supplies to keep"
" them healthy enough to get to friendly territory."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5180
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"REBEL_VS_FEDERATION_SAVED_LIST_CHECK_CARGO\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BOMB_HEAL_REQ\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Now that they're safe an engineer offers to join your crew and the rest tell"
" you of a hidden Federation base a few jumps from here."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5191
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at the distress beacon near a small asteroid belt and find a ship"
" with pirate markings partially crushed between two large rocks. It must "
"have been illegally mining the belt without proper equipment."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5194
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Try to dislodge the ship by shooting at the rocks."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5198
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Destroy and loot the ship. They're just pirates."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5202
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "This is not your problem; let them sort it out themselves."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5206
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BEAM_DAMAGE\"]/text"
msgstr "(Beam Weapon) Carefully cut the ship out."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5208
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[@req=\"WEAPONS_BEAM_DAMAGE\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You use your beam to make a few precision cuts in the asteroid. The ship "
"gives a quick burst of thrust and the rock crumbles away. They thank you and"
" offer some of the resources they have collected."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5213
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[@req=\"COMBAT_BEAM_DRONE_LIST\"]/text"
msgstr "(Beam Drone) Have your drone cut the ship out."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5215
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[@req=\"COMBAT_BEAM_DRONE_LIST\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You program the drone to work carefully around the trapped ship. In a short "
"time it allows the ship to easily slip out of its cage."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5222
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER\"]/choice[@req=\"COMBAT_BEAM_DRONE_LIST\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr "They thank you and offer some of the resources they have collected."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5231
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER_SHOOT\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"You take a few careful shots but you expose a mineral patch in the rock that"
" reacts violently with your weapon. A shockwave forces you back as debris "
"pelts against your hull. When you regain control you find there is not much "
"left of the ship."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5236
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER_SHOOT\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You fire a few volleys into the rock and it starts to shudder and break "
"apart. Without shields the pirate ship takes a beating but eventually pulls "
"free. They thank you for your assistance."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5242
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER_LOOT\"]/event[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"You decide the pirate is not worth saving and fire a few volleys into their "
"hull causing the ship to depressurize and break apart. You move in to loot "
"the remains."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5246
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"DISTRESS_TRAPPED_MINER_LOOT\"]/event[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"You decide the pirate is not worth saving and fire a few volleys into their "
"hull. Before you can scrap the remains another pirate ship flashes on your "
"radar. Perhaps they saw your deed, or perhaps they want to claim the spoils "
"for themselves, but for whatever reason, they're charging weapons!"

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5253
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You find a number of ships fleeing from a small space station. You hail "
"them, asking what's wrong: \"Help! We're being overrun by some sort of giant"
" alien spiders!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5256
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Send the crew to help! Giant alien spiders are no joke."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5260
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Leave them alone."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5262
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You can't risk fighting some unknown alien on every backwater station you "
"come across. You prepare to jump."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5266
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/choice[@req=\"mantis_crew\""
" and @lvl=\"1\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Mantis Crew Member) Send your Mantis on the hunt — to the Mantis, giant "
"spiders are considered a delicacy."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:5270
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"DISTRESS_INFESTATION\"]/choice[@req=\"mantis_crew\""
" and @lvl=\"2\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Two Mantis Crew Members) Send two of your Mantises on the hunt — to the "
