#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:58990
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_MORGAN\"]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Ask them about the space-bot and the station on which it was designed."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:58992
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_MORGAN\"]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Morgan says that he sneaked onto one of the ships bound for the space "
"station, hoping to destroy the central processor of the huge robot. "
"According to him, the robot possessed an advanced artificial intelligence "
"and a self-reproduction module. The existence of such a system could "
"endanger the existence of all living things, so Morgan decided to disable "
"the space-bot. The Zoltan only managed to destroy the self-reproduction "
"module before they were discovered. The space-bot locked them in one of the "
"cargo bays of one of the repair units and sent the Zoltan back to the "
"research station to be interrogated, and then most likely killed or sent to "
"lifelong exile in uranium mines. Morgan suggests that you take them on board"
" as an engineer."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:58994
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_MORGAN\"]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Agree, provided that they will inform you of the coordinates of the research"
" station and go to it with you."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:58996
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//eventList[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_MORGAN\"]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr "Morgan gladly accepts your terms."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:58997
