#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59011
#, fuzzy
msgid "data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The jump takes you to a beacon located at a safe distance from a newly "
"formed black hole. The view is amazing, and your entire crew doesn't look "
"away from the portholes, enjoying the spectacle. Scanners discover the "
"station, which was mentioned in the archives of the huge space-bot. Morgan "
"confirms that it was here that they worked."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59013
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Contact the station."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59015
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You're greeted by the manager of the research station 'Nemesis'. \"My name "
"is Professor Lebedinsky. If you would, tell me who you are, and explain just"
" what you are doing here. This is private property, so don't play any games "
"with me.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59017
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"Introduce yourself and say that you're flying on a very important mission, "
"and are just passing through."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59019
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Well then, fly on and don't bother our exploration of this remarkable "
"black hole.\" The manager shuts off the screen, indicating that he no longer"
" intends to talk to you about anything. You start charging up the engines."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59023
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Greet the manager and ask him about the space-bot."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59025
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Really now, you know more than you should, captain. Yes, indeed we "
"developed a super-ship, but the financing of this project was discontinued, "
"and all developments were frozen. When the Rebels learned of this, they "
"certainly wanted to get a space-bot to fight the Federation. This ship has a"
" special advanced artificial intelligence, gravitational engines, the "
"principle of which... But, you still don't understand...\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59027
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr ""
"Agree. You're in fact not really strong in the principles of operating "
"engines."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59029
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"So, the Rebels promised us funding, protection from pirates, regular "
"supplies of food and necessary equipment. In return, we had to finish work "
"on the ship for them. Of course, we agreed. After all, now we were able to "
"complete the project, which we have been working on for many years. "
"Unfortunately, or fortunately, we didn't manage to put the unique Zoltan "
"shield technology on it, since the Rebels hastened us very much and set "
"strict deadlines for completing all the work.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59031
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Listen on..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59033
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"At this point, the manager notices Morgan behind you. \"Well, well, well, "
"now who do we have there? Hello, Morgan. Are you still set on destroying our"
" wonderful project? And what did you tell the captain?\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59035
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Answer yourself."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59037
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Professor. You have not said anything about the self-reproduction module. "
"Don't you think that it is quite a dangerous machine, especially in the "
"hands of the Rebels?\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59039
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Lebedinsky begins to burn up..."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59041
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"No, I don't think so, Captain! You just don't understand! It's a "
"masterpiece! A scientific miracle! And moreover, who are you to judge how "
"the machine will behave?\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59043
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Why not for me to judge? In the end, my mission is to deliver important "
"information to the Federation's base, on which the outcome of the war with "
"the Rebels depends and the future of all the peoples of the Galaxy.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59045
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You are too arrogant and stupid, Captain! And you also have a fugitive on "
"board. We will destroy them along with your ship. Open fire!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59050
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Maybe not for me to judge. But you seem to forget about the three laws of "
"robotics! And this is the first thing to remember when creating a robot!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59052
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You are right, Captain. My grandfather, Phil Farnsworth, always said that "
"scientists are separated from insanity only by the primary laws. If you did "
"not destroy the robot, then I will do so myself! Fortunately, I'm not so mad"
" as to forget about the mandatory installation of a self-destruct module. "
"Thank you for unveiling my eyes, allow me, in gratitude, to install a Zoltan"
" shield on your ship.\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59054
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Thank the professor and start docking with the station."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59056
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"While the Zoltan shield is being installed, you and the crew skip a glass at"
" a local bar, admiring the incredible spectacle of a black hole slowly "
"devouring several bright stars. Soon you return to the ship and prepare to "
"continue the journey."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59067
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Let Morgan answer."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59069
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You're just an insane old fool, Lebedinsky! This machine shouldn't exist! "
"Otherwise, we all will pay for such a 'wonderful project'!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59071
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "The manager's face changes."

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59073
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.rawclobber$//event[@name=\"BLACK_ZOLTAN_3\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice[2]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You're just an incredible fool, Morgan, and not worthy of the title of "
"scientist. Besides, you are now a runaway criminal, so I will destroy both "
"you and your new friends! Open fire!\""

#: src-ru/data/events.xml.rawclobber:59088
